ca Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">英伟达完成对初创公司Kumo AI的收购，三位联合创始人已正式入职</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">智谱拟募资150亿元冲刺科创板，计划建立A+H双重上市平台</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">GitLab宣布裁员14%并重构Git基础设施以应对百倍AI工作负载</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌发布开源多模态模型Gemma 4 12B，支持视觉音频直接处理</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/46c323c50c03f3b2d17466d7b60843e9.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌正式发布统一多模态模型Gemma 4 12B，该模型拥有12亿参数，核心创新在于取消了传统视觉与音频编码器，通过轻量级嵌入层直接处理多模态数据。视觉输入仅需矩阵乘法与归一化操作，音频信号则直接投影至文本token空间，显著降低了计算复杂度。性能方面，Gemma 4 12B表现接近26B MoE模型，具备卓越的多步推理与Agent工作流能力，并集成Multi-Token Prediction（MTP）drafters以提升推理速度。硬件需求方面，该模型仅需16GB显存或统一内存，支持在高端笔记本等消费级硬件上本地运行。Gemma 4 12B采用Apache 2.0许可证开源，权重已上线Hugging Face与Kaggle。开发者可通过LM Studio、Ollama、MLX、SGLang及vLLM等框架进行</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌Gemini App月活突破9亿，搜索AI概览功能用户达25亿</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/27234ec0b3f822767f2f5a2fd87eb889.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌母公司Alphabet最新披露，Gemini App月活跃用户数已突破9亿，一年内实现翻倍增长。该模型底层能力已全面接入谷歌旗下13款用户量超10亿的超级应用，包括搜索、Gmail、Android、Chrome及YouTube。此外，谷歌搜索集成的AI Overviews功能月活用户已达25亿，覆盖全球超30%的人口。在技术与成本优化方面，得益于Gemini 3架构的底层硬件与工程突破，核心AI响应算力成本降低超30%。谷歌计划本月内推出Gemini 3.5 Pro大模型，以接替此前发布的Gemini 3.5 Flash，持续强化其在多模态模型领域的竞争优势。这一系列数据表明，谷歌正通过将AI深度嵌入成熟基础设施，加速实现消费级AI的规模化普及。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达完成对初创公司Kumo AI的收购，三位联合创始人已正式入职</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8ba88b9d91febbbc7bd322b257d80990.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达近日正式完成对人工智能初创公司Kumo AI的资产收购，旨在强化企业级AI商业预测领域的底层技术能力。Kumo AI的三位联合创始人Vanja Josifovski、Hema Raghavan及Jure Leskovec已于上个月正式加入英伟达，成为公司核心技术团队成员。Kumo AI成立于四年前，专注于开发垂直领域的商业预测基础模型，通过预测算法辅助企业进行精准决策。此次收购被视为英伟达在算力之外，进一步完善软件与应用生态的关键布局。行业分析认为，英伟达有望将Kumo AI的预测算法与自身硬件算力深度整合，为全球企业客户提供涵盖算力、底层框架及商业决策预测的全栈式AI解决方案，加速大模型技术在产业端的落地与生产力转化。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">智谱拟募资150亿元冲刺科创板，计划建立A+H双重上市平台</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/94ead9c7f00cb7d5082089e37d9a353b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">智谱于6月1日发布公告，正式建议申请首次公开发行A股并在上海证券交易所科创板上市，拟募资不超过150亿元。此次募资中，120亿元将投入人工智能通用基座大模型研发，20亿元用于大模型MaaS一站式服务平台建设，其余10亿元补充流动资金。智谱此前已于今年1月在港交所挂牌，此次“回A”旨在构建“A+H”双重上市平台。财务数据显示，智谱2025年营收达7.24亿元，同比增长131.9%，研发投入达31.8亿元。尽管年内亏损47.18亿元，但其MaaS平台年度经常性收入（ARR）增长60倍，API调用量在调价83%的情况下仍实现400%增长。此次行动得益于科创板改革将人工智能纳入第五套上市标准，允许未盈利前沿科技企业上市。智谱此举标志着大模型企业正转向由内地资本市场进行定价，通过商业应用与生态链接接受市场检验。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">GitLab宣布裁员14%并重构Git基础设施以应对百倍AI工作负载</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/273d5f15835d88f2e3c6d7dee4134883.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">GitLab周二宣布裁员约14%（约350名员工）并退出22个国家，旨在精简管理层级并重新调配资源。此次重组核心在于全面重构Git基础设施，以应对AI智能体带来的百倍流量增长。CEO Bill Staples表示，AI智能体产生的提交压力已超传统架构极限，公司正联手AI实验室重建针对智能体优化的API，用于代码上下文存储与检索，并加大对AI编排工具、上下文层及治理工具的研发投入。尽管面临架构压力，GitLab第一季度营收仍达2.64亿美元，同比增长23%，毛利率维持在88%。此次重组预计产生3000万至3500万美元费用。这一举措标志着GitLab正从依赖人力规模转向追求机器规模，以适应AI时代开发者基础设施的技术洗牌。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
